{"schema_version":"1.8.0","id":"ALSA-2026:49667","published":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-08-06T16:15:06.627090440Z","related":["CVE-2026-13757"],"summary":"Moderate: p11-kit security update","details":"The p11-kit packages provide a mechanism to manage PKCS#11 modules. The p11-kit-trust subpackage includes a PKCS#11 trust module that provides certificate anchors and black lists based on configuration files.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * p11-kit: Stack exhaustion via unbounded recursion in RPC attribute parsing (CVE-2026-13757)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"p11-kit","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/p11-kit"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.26.4-1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:49667.json"}},{"package":{"name":"p11-kit-client","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/p11-kit-client"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.26.4-1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:49667.json"}},{"package":{"name":"p11-kit-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/p11-kit-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.26.4-1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:49667.json"}},{"package":{"name":"p11-kit-server","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/p11-kit-server"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.26.4-1.el9_8"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/adviso